- The first response is complete server-rendered HTML.
- Function components handle stateless snippets; decorated classes own state and actions.
- There is no React dependency, virtual DOM, or hydration pass.

# A complete site with shared defaults

> Unreleased development documentation. Package metadata is 0.12.0, but these features are not claimed to be published in that npm version. Use the matching packed artifact; do not install latest and assume compatibility.

Define metadata, layout, CSS, caching, and asset export once, then keep each page focused on its content.

